From ce59ce36440d36c3011e27bdff84dabecec47f80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 09:46:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make Unsubscribe/Update Email Preferences links actually
 work, and add a one-click bulk fix for hand-pasted template footers

sendTemplate() now signs a real {{unsubscribeUrl}} for every send by
looking up the recipient's Contact + Brand, the same mechanism the
newsletter sender already used one-off. Every template pasted into the
Email page's editor carries a CAN-SPAM footer from whatever design tool
made it, with a placeholder mailing address and a dead Unsubscribe/Update
Email Preferences link -- fixEmailFooters() (new button on the Email
page) rewrites all of those in one click instead of re-editing each
design by hand.
